Sorry not multiple hadoop-hdfs.sh files, but multiple "hdfs" script. One that R was referring to was an old one which had reference to HADOOP_LIBEXEC_DIR=hadoop-hdfs/bin/../libexec/hdfs-config.sh. Which is not true for recent version of hadoop.

